    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Vow-sworn Crusaders",
    "summary": "As [battle round 1](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, you can pick 1 **Vow** from those below. It is active for your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units for the rest of the battle.\n\n**Abhor the Witch, Destroy the Witch**: the unit's melee attacks against a **PSYKER** unit get **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** and **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)**.\n\n**Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds**: the unit's melee attacks get +1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) against a target whose T is higher than the attack's S.\n\n**Uphold the Honour of the Emperor**: if the unit is **INFANTRY**, it gets both of these:\n\n- as [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, an [objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) it controls becomes **[secured](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives)**\n- it can still [start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions) after making an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**\n\nYour army can contain **BLACK TEMPLARS** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
